1
00:02:17,845 --> 00:02:26,995
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:33,719
Cerkutay, you should have gotten some rest first.

3
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:38,319
I can't heal if I don't work, my
Bey. Thank Allah I am fine.

4
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:42,359
I want all preparations to be done by tomorrow.

5
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:44,919
First, we will save Gunduz Bey.

6
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:48,239
Then if Allah permits,
Atranos will be our property.

7
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:51,199
If Allah permits, my Bey.

8
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:59,079
Let's take a look.

9
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:25,079
Victory lies in the craftmanship before battle.

10
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:27,839
It lies in the skill. Praise be, good work.

11
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,919
Thank you, Osman Bey.

12
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,919
Thanks.

13
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:35,399
What's the situation of the cart?

14
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,839
My Bey...

15
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:44,639
...we are following the instructions
drawn by Shahzade Alaeddin.

16
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:48,799
The masters are following them too.

17
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:56,359
Brothers, allow us.

18
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:01,599
In these veins...

19
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:03,879
...there will be gunpowder.

20
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:08,719
And we will destroy the infidels in Atranos.

21
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:12,679
And this cart will bring Imren's head to us.

22
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:19,119
But first, we will go to the frontier market.

23
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:21,879
We will take Olcaytu's gold and the ambassadors.

24
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:25,719
And from there, we will go to Imren
and take Gunduz Bey in exchange.

25
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:29,159
If Allah permits, my Bey.

26
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:35,999
Alps are ready for the battle.

27
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,839
Mehmet Bey will join us on the way.

28
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:39,759
Alright, alright.

29
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,759
Stop.

30
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:46,959
You are working, but you are still wounded.

31
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:51,039
My Bey, my heart is ready.

32
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:54,439
It wants ghaza. Please allow me.

33
00:04:54,840 --> 00:05:00,239
And you told me that we would
try a smaller cart in the market.

34
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:05,679
You said that we would surprise
Imren Tegin as if he is a small bird.

35
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:07,639
I want to witness it.

36
00:05:08,880 --> 00:05:12,199
We will surprise him, yeah.

37
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:17,119
Come on.

38
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:31,399
Imren ruined everything by trusting Osman.

39
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:34,319
This was going to be the base of Crusaders.

40
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:36,879
Now it's going to be our grave if Osman attacks us.

41
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:39,639
Don't be afraid, Cardinal. We are getting prepared.

42
00:05:39,640 --> 00:05:42,239
Osman will die if he attacks us.

43
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,839
Imren gathered all his soldiers to the market.

44
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:59,959
Look, the Byzantine soldiers
with long spears are also here.

45
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:03,519
They strengthened the entrance.

46
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:07,239
There are long range archers on top of the gate.

47
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:11,319
We would be dead before we reach the gates.

48
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:15,079
It will be tough to take the frontier market, huh?

49
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,959
Wait.

50
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:21,439
We haven't made our last move yet.

51
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:25,239
Something's happening.

52
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:34,799
Imren keeps Olcaytu's gold here for security.

53
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:37,639
The ambassadors are still here too.

54
00:06:37,640 --> 00:06:40,079
But they are getting ready to leave.

55
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:42,039
We need to be quick.

56
00:06:42,520 --> 00:06:44,519
Come on.

57
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:10,719
I knew you wouldn't let that ignoble
Imren take frontier market my Bey.

58
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:12,719
May Allah bless you.

59
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:15,159
Praise be!

60
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:34,519
Where are you going?

61
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:40,239
I'm looking for Commander Husrev.

62
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:44,399
Not everyone who looks for him can find him.

63
00:07:45,080 --> 00:07:46,399
What's your name?

64
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:48,679
Commander Husrev and I fought side by side.

65
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:50,679
He is good with double daggers.

66
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:52,759
His right arm is injured.

67
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:56,639
He got injured in a battle.

68
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,959
His eyes look sharp.

69
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,879
Yours aren't: like that though.

70
00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:07,319
Konur!

71
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:25,199
How can you not recognize me?

72
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:30,119
If you don't remind me of yourself...

73
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:32,119
...how could I remember you, Konur?

74
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:34,119
You're right.

75
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,119
What is it?

76
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:38,999
From now on, I don't follow Osman Bey's orders.

77
00:08:39,558 --> 00:08:40,999
I'll establish my own Beyhood.

78
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:42,679
I'll fight my own battle.

79
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,879
Okay brother.

80
00:08:46,640 --> 00:08:47,759
Do it.

81
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,439
What do you want from us?

82
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:51,079
Hungry horse can't last long.

83
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,999
A lone soldier can't win.

84
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:57,159
You'll stand behind me from now on.

85
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:59,319
Like the old days.

86
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:02,839
Old days are gone, Konur.

87
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:06,199
Seljuk is no longer here.

88
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,919
We only scavenge for a living.

89
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:11,759
Go away.

90
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:15,439
Go and look for others.

91
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:21,079
I can tell.

92
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:24,319
You don't want Ghaza.

93
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:27,319
You only survive.

94
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,679
But you forget your real goal.

95
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:34,359
Now I'll tell you want you need.

96
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,239
And you'll like it.

97
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:41,719
Tell us what you want.

98
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:43,919
I'll give you gold.

99
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:46,119
Not a little bit.

100
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,439
They're Olcaytu Han's gold.

101
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:49,799
Ilkhanid's gold.

102
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:04,679
Mother.

103
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:10,199
We want to talk to you before father comes.

104
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:15,319
About the market?

105
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:19,719
It's not right to talk
about this during a battle...

106
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:23,839
...but waiting won't do us good.

107
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:29,319
Mother.

108
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:32,039
Me and Gonca made a decision.

109
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:36,039
We want to marry.

110
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,879
Gonca Hatun must be Kayi's daughter.

111
00:10:50,040 --> 00:10:52,119
You know how this will end.

112
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:53,879
And Gonca..

113
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,519
...is engaged to Candaroglu.

114
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,239
Yes Bala Hatun.

115
00:10:57,880 --> 00:10:59,239
We know what will happen.

116
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:04,279
It'll be hard...

117
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:06,919
..but we're adamant.

118
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:14,479
If you'll allow us, this is what we want.

119
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:20,559
When our duty is done I'll talk to father.

120
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,919
Will you support us mother?

121
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:33,319
Bala Hatun. Osman Bey and Mehmet Bey are coming.

122
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:36,599
Come on.

123
00:11:54,680 --> 00:11:55,519
Peace be with you.

124
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:56,759
Peace be upon you.

125
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:59,039
What's the situation of the frontier market Bala?

126
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:01,719
Imren increased precautions.

127
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:04,479
But he can't be victorious against us.

128
00:12:06,600 --> 00:12:09,559
So you say it's time.

129
00:12:11,920 --> 00:12:15,119
Don't stand back Kanyumaz, listen well.

130
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:18,119
We're going to take the frontier market.

131
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:20,039
Tell them.

132
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:27,479
They reinforced the door, my bey.

133
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:31,359
They placed many obstacles at the entrance
of the frontier market and at the center of it.

134
00:12:31,360 --> 00:12:35,199
Behind those obstacles, there are soldiers.

135
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:37,999
They strengthened the entrances
of the frontier market my bey.

136
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:40,319
They made them stronger with logs.

137
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:43,639
Soldiers constantly guard them.

138
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:46,879
You're telling me that
they're defending it like Turks.

139
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:51,599
But we're going to attack
them from their Byzantine side.

140
00:12:52,640 --> 00:12:54,639
What do you have in mind Osman Bey?

141
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:56,639
What aren't you telling us?

142
00:12:56,640 --> 00:13:01,319
We're going to attack them
with the thing they believe in.

143
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,039
Cerkutay.

144
00:13:03,040 --> 00:13:03,919
My bey.

145
00:13:03,920 --> 00:13:05,839
Let all the alps know.

146
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:08,119
As you wish my bey.

147
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:12,639
Now.

148
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,879
We're going to lay siege to...

149
00:13:16,280 --> 00:13:20,079
...the frontier market from the front and the behind.

150
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:21,519
Bala Hatun.

151
00:13:22,400 --> 00:13:25,919
Alaeddin, Gonca and the baciyans.

152
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:30,639
You're going to go in slowly from the behind.

153
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:35,959
When we attack from the
front, you're going to attack too.

154
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,599
As you wish my bey.

155
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:42,159
The Cardinal and the ambassadors.

156
00:13:42,160 --> 00:13:46,119
When we attack them they'll start to run.

157
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:48,319
You have to be alert.

158
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:50,559
We're going to catch them quickly.

159
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:54,359
May our ghaza be mubarak.

160
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:56,279
Ameen.

161
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:58,719
Come on.

162
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:19,679
It's noon but we still are stuck here, my bey.

163
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:22,479
We have to be cautious.

164
00:14:22,920 --> 00:14:27,479
If they see us they'll know that we
know where the hidden passages are.

165
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:35,839
But we won't wait for them
to get out of here either.

166
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:36,599
Oguz.

167
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:37,239
My bey.

168
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:39,399
Let Hasan know too.

169
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:41,319
As you wish my bey.

170
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:49,519
Elcim Hatun.

171
00:14:49,760 --> 00:14:51,959
Don't be sad now.

172
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:54,799
We're going to get your father out of here.

173
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:56,559
I hope so.

174
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:00,719
My father was right in front of me...

175
00:15:00,720 --> 00:15:02,959
...and I couldn't do anything.

176
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:06,879
If we made a move to save Gunduz Bey...

177
00:15:06,880 --> 00:15:09,919
...that move wouldn't save him..

178
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:12,039
...but would get him killed.

179
00:15:12,680 --> 00:15:14,919
But now...

180
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:17,519
Now we're the powerful ones.

181
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:19,839
We know where the hidden passages are.

182
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:21,919
The only think we have to do..

183
00:15:21,920 --> 00:15:24,559
...is to make it out of here alive.

184
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,879
Elcim Hatun.

185
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:30,799
With Allah's permission we'll take both...

186
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:32,879
...Atranos and Gunduz Bey.

187
00:15:32,880 --> 00:15:34,959
We will right?

188
00:15:36,040 --> 00:15:37,999
We will.

189
00:15:44,120 --> 00:15:44,959
My Shahzade.

190
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:46,679
What is it Hasan?

191
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:49,279
They found our horses.

192
00:15:52,800 --> 00:15:53,959
How many are there?

193
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:55,839
25 for now.

194
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:57,639
They're in groups of 5.

195
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:59,999
We will cover our faces.

196
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:02,479
Even thought they see us,
they won't be sure about it.

197
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:06,439
If they recognize us then...

198
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:09,679
...we won't let any one of them live.

199
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:13,719
We don't have many people...

200
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:16,959
...but you still say that Orhan Bey.

201
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:18,879
They have more people...

202
00:16:18,880 --> 00:16:20,639
...but we...

203
00:16:21,400 --> 00:16:23,599
We are Turkish, Elcim Hatun.

204
00:16:25,520 --> 00:16:26,759
Come on.

205
00:16:36,280 --> 00:16:37,879
Oguz.

206
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:48,399
Come on.

207
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:03,479
Boran and Konur.

208
00:17:03,600 --> 00:17:06,439
It's going to cause Osman's
alps to fight each other.

209
00:17:06,440 --> 00:17:09,117
If it doesn't, we will make it happen.

210
00:17:09,358 --> 00:17:11,679
You did your part.

211
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:13,999
Now it's my turn.

212
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:28,679
You!

213
00:17:28,840 --> 00:17:31,239
Traitor!

214
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:35,319
It was so easy to trick you.

215
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:38,839
You can only trick yourself.

216
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:44,199
Do your best!

217
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:47,999
Neither me, nor Osman Bey...

218
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:51,199
...will kneel before you!

219
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:55,959
I will die with my honor, but
I will never kneel before you!

220
00:17:57,080 --> 00:17:59,439
Like your daughter-in-law Ayca?

221
00:18:00,400 --> 00:18:03,799
You! What are you talking about?

222
00:18:05,040 --> 00:18:07,079
You were so blind.

223
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:09,679
You couldn't see the truth.

224
00:18:10,560 --> 00:18:14,039
But Ayca was different, she was smart.

225
00:18:16,120 --> 00:18:17,799
What did you do to my daughter!?

226
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:25,839
To stop Kayis to unite and kill Elcim..

227
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:28,319
...I poisoned poor Ayca.

228
00:18:30,600 --> 00:18:32,839
Holofira was a fool.

229
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:35,679
She sacrificed herself to save me.

230
00:18:37,520 --> 00:18:39,839
But Ayca was smart.

231
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:45,239
Although the poison clouded her
mind, she knew I was behind everything.

232
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:52,279
When your treacherous
daughter-in-law came to me for alliance...

233
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:53,919
...I killed her.

234
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:55,879
You ignoble!

235
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:59,559
You will all end up like her.

236
00:18:59,760 --> 00:19:02,559
Enjoy your time here for now.

237
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:11,999
I swear I am not going to die before I...

238
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:16,399
...kill you! May Allah be my witness!

239
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:20,239
You ignobles! You evil people!

240
00:19:20,520 --> 00:19:22,879
You cruel people!

241
00:19:22,910 --> 00:19:26,199
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

242
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:43,159
Who is that, Cardinal?

243
00:19:43,360 --> 00:19:46,439
The papacy did not inform me of a squad coming.

244
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:18,119
Turks are coming!
Close the gates!

245
00:20:18,120 --> 00:20:19,719
Turks are coming! Close the gates!

246
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:21,719
Hurry up! Close it!

247
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:22,879
The Righteous!

248
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:46,399
Attack!

249
00:20:47,880 --> 00:20:49,639
Come on alps!

250
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:52,599
-Sisters! Attack!
-Allah is the Greatest!

251
00:20:52,600 --> 00:20:55,279
Sisters, attack!

252
00:21:04,520 --> 00:21:06,239
Alps, attack!

253
00:21:12,240 --> 00:21:15,199
Baysungur, check the backside!

254
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:18,439
No one can go backside. If
you want, go check it yourself!

255
00:21:18,600 --> 00:21:20,279
Come on!

256
00:21:58,840 --> 00:22:00,279
Come here.

257
00:22:00,280 --> 00:22:02,279
You think you can have my market?

258
00:22:37,040 --> 00:22:38,599
You kicked me out.

259
00:22:38,760 --> 00:22:40,599
But I'll never leave you my Bey.

260
00:22:41,120 --> 00:22:42,599
I'll sacrifice myself for you.

261
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:53,239
I scattered all of you like dogs.

262
00:22:53,920 --> 00:22:55,839
Another one. Come.

263
00:22:57,160 --> 00:22:58,679
First I'll catch you.

264
00:22:59,120 --> 00:23:01,239
Then I'll kill you.

265
00:23:31,280 --> 00:23:33,519
Praise be, my brave brothers.

266
00:23:33,920 --> 00:23:35,359
Great soldiers.

267
00:23:51,080 --> 00:23:54,279
Are you slow? They're still standing.

268
00:23:57,120 --> 00:23:58,559
Are you calling me old?

269
00:23:58,560 --> 00:24:01,719
No. Praise be to you.

270
00:24:02,040 --> 00:24:03,719
Good. I thought so.

271
00:24:08,200 --> 00:24:09,199
Bala.

272
00:24:40,160 --> 00:24:40,879
Wait.

273
00:24:42,120 --> 00:24:44,399
You trust your swords too much.

274
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:45,599
Come.

275
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:16,679
Alps!

276
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:19,839
Kill everyone except the messengers.

277
00:25:20,160 --> 00:25:20,919
Come on!

278
00:25:22,480 --> 00:25:24,599
Long live Osman Bey!

279
00:25:36,720 --> 00:25:37,559
Gonca.

280
00:25:37,920 --> 00:25:39,439
Gonca, it's too late now.

281
00:25:39,560 --> 00:25:40,639
I'll face anything.

282
00:25:41,040 --> 00:25:43,519
Then don't stop until
it's done Alaeddin Bey.

283
00:25:43,520 --> 00:25:45,359
I won't. I won't.

284
00:25:45,360 --> 00:25:46,519
-Come on.
-Come on.

285
00:25:46,720 --> 00:25:47,799
Come on.

286
00:25:52,800 --> 00:25:54,559
We are victorious!

287
00:26:23,240 --> 00:26:25,759
I wish I killed you before Osman.

288
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:29,319
Really? Messengers are
more important than you I guess.

289
00:26:29,880 --> 00:26:31,519
You've lived for too long.

290
00:27:07,200 --> 00:27:09,119
Come on then.

291
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:30,559
If you kill us the Pope will shred you...

292
00:27:30,560 --> 00:27:32,279
Shut up.

293
00:27:32,840 --> 00:27:34,119
Shut it.

294
00:27:34,120 --> 00:27:36,319
You attacked our lands.

295
00:27:36,320 --> 00:27:40,359
Do you think the land of the
Turks' don't have an owner?

296
00:27:41,080 --> 00:27:44,559
And like that wasn't enough,
you think of attacking Jerusalem.

297
00:27:48,240 --> 00:27:50,039
Envoy...

298
00:27:50,040 --> 00:27:52,679
Come here.

299
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:57,439
Come here and tell me.

300
00:27:57,920 --> 00:28:01,999
How many days does it take to come
here from the lands you were born in?

301
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:04,919
How many weeks? Tell me.

302
00:28:04,920 --> 00:28:08,359
How many weeks does it take to
come here form your homelands?

303
00:28:08,360 --> 00:28:11,599
You bring war to lands you
don't know at all, is that so?

304
00:28:19,960 --> 00:28:22,759
You want to let the other Christians know...

305
00:28:22,920 --> 00:28:25,879
...and start the
Crusades is that so?

306
00:28:27,560 --> 00:28:30,719
So you want to start Crusades...

307
00:28:30,840 --> 00:28:33,039
Look at me.

308
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:39,999
My name is Osman Bey.

309
00:28:43,600 --> 00:28:46,599
I'm ending your Crusades...

310
00:28:52,080 --> 00:28:54,519
...before they even started.

311
00:28:54,720 --> 00:28:56,559
We're just doing what we're told.

312
00:28:56,560 --> 00:28:57,999
We do...

313
00:28:58,000 --> 00:29:00,239
...what the kings and the Pope tell us to do.

314
00:29:00,240 --> 00:29:02,599
You have a saying.

315
00:29:02,600 --> 00:29:04,639
No harm is to be done to an envoy.

316
00:29:04,640 --> 00:29:06,919
You're not even an envoy.

317
00:29:06,920 --> 00:29:10,519
You can only be the devil in a human body.

318
00:29:11,080 --> 00:29:14,999
Envoys like you will get
hurt and they will be killed too.

319
00:29:44,640 --> 00:29:46,519
There's someone there.

320
00:30:01,520 --> 00:30:04,239
I heard something, let's go and check it out.

321
00:30:17,840 --> 00:30:19,599
They must've heard it.

322
00:30:19,600 --> 00:30:21,359
Drag these to aside.

323
00:30:21,360 --> 00:30:23,039
Or hold on..

324
00:31:01,120 --> 00:31:03,599
It's the land which you're not used to.

325
00:31:03,600 --> 00:31:06,039
It must be hard to walk on it.

326
00:31:06,680 --> 00:31:10,599
And conquering it, impossible.

327
00:31:17,120 --> 00:31:18,359
Cerkutay.

328
00:31:18,360 --> 00:31:19,359
My bey.

329
00:31:19,360 --> 00:31:22,119
You'll go to Imren.

330
00:31:22,120 --> 00:31:25,959
You will tell him that we have
the Cardinal and the envoys.

331
00:31:26,480 --> 00:31:30,759
And he will give us Gunduz Bey in exchange of them.

332
00:31:34,360 --> 00:31:36,159
Turahan.

333
00:31:38,560 --> 00:31:41,519
You're going to take this with you as proof.

334
00:31:42,080 --> 00:31:45,639
You'll do that so that they don't hurt Gunduz Bey.

335
00:31:45,800 --> 00:31:48,119
As you wish my bey.

336
00:31:49,480 --> 00:31:52,879
Now, Imren must be feeling good.

337
00:31:52,960 --> 00:31:55,639
Let's go to him quickly to ruin it.

338
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:01,519
Tie these dogs to the horse.

339
00:32:01,720 --> 00:32:02,919
As you command my Bey.

340
00:32:02,920 --> 00:32:04,959
Get up!

341
00:32:05,360 --> 00:32:08,119
Get up! Come on!

342
00:32:09,960 --> 00:32:11,359
Come on!

343
00:32:11,360 --> 00:32:13,439
Walk!

344
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:22,039
Well, Mehmet Bey.

345
00:32:23,720 --> 00:32:26,999
We gave frontier market to the
infidels without your knowledge.

346
00:32:28,120 --> 00:32:33,319
But thanks to the frontier market
we defeated many crusaders.

347
00:32:37,960 --> 00:32:40,559
Raise the glorious sanjac of Germiyans.

348
00:32:41,160 --> 00:32:42,759
The frontier market...

349
00:32:43,560 --> 00:32:45,959
...belongs to Germiyan again.

350
00:32:51,360 --> 00:32:54,439
I thought wrong of you all this time, Osman Bey.

351
00:32:54,440 --> 00:32:58,279
Our anger and ambition clouded our eyes.

352
00:32:58,880 --> 00:33:00,599
Thank you.

353
00:33:02,680 --> 00:33:04,959
May your frontier market be prosperous.

354
00:33:05,240 --> 00:33:07,159
Thank you.

355
00:33:07,400 --> 00:33:10,519
I will inform my father about
what happened, Osman Bey.

356
00:33:17,520 --> 00:33:22,039
Well, alps, bring the gold of Olcaytu.

357
00:33:22,840 --> 00:33:27,079
We did what needed to be done,
and gave what was entrusted to us.

358
00:33:27,960 --> 00:33:29,879
Now it's time to take them.

359
00:33:31,000 --> 00:33:32,799
Come on.

360
00:33:44,680 --> 00:33:47,479
Go on, Osman.

361
00:33:48,720 --> 00:33:51,439
You don't know what's going to happen to you.

362
00:33:52,520 --> 00:33:54,079
I pity you.

363
00:34:03,960 --> 00:34:05,279
What happened here?

364
00:34:05,280 --> 00:34:07,679
Turks! They attacked us.

365
00:34:08,040 --> 00:34:10,079
They killed 3 of our soldiers.

366
00:34:16,560 --> 00:34:18,399
You are not one of us!

367
00:34:27,760 --> 00:34:29,998
Remove your helmets.

368
00:34:34,320 --> 00:34:37,079
I thought you would bring me to a palace.

369
00:34:37,320 --> 00:34:39,399
But you made me crawl on the ground.

370
00:34:39,400 --> 00:34:41,918
But it worked.

371
00:34:41,920 --> 00:34:44,079
Of course it worked.

372
00:34:44,440 --> 00:34:46,159
It worked.

373
00:34:46,159 --> 00:34:47,958
Elcim Hatun.

374
00:34:48,480 --> 00:34:51,998
You look happier as you cut down infidels.

375
00:34:52,199 --> 00:34:55,119
Come on, most of it is done.

376
00:34:55,120 --> 00:34:57,439
We need to leave here.

377
00:35:01,480 --> 00:35:03,599
Turks are there!

378
00:35:08,760 --> 00:35:10,599
May Allah help us.

379
00:35:10,600 --> 00:35:12,959
Allah is with us!

380
00:35:13,240 --> 00:35:15,439
We will lure them to the forest.

381
00:35:15,640 --> 00:35:19,119
There we will kill them all.

382
00:35:20,720 --> 00:35:22,479
Send word to Atranos.

383
00:35:32,440 --> 00:35:34,159
Orhan Bey, come on!

384
00:35:34,160 --> 00:35:35,439
My shahzade!

385
00:35:35,560 --> 00:35:38,279
That word won't reach Atranos!

386
00:35:45,800 --> 00:35:50,079
No matter what!

387
00:36:27,040 --> 00:36:29,119
What you did was dangerous.

388
00:36:29,120 --> 00:36:31,759
I had to do it, Elcim Hatun.

389
00:36:31,960 --> 00:36:34,159
I did what I needed to do.

390
00:36:43,600 --> 00:36:45,679
Come on.

391
00:36:53,240 --> 00:36:56,799
Our longing will be over now,
Gonca. I will talk to my father tonight.

392
00:36:56,960 --> 00:36:59,119
And I will talk to my brother.

393
00:36:59,600 --> 00:37:01,439
I'll send word to my father.

394
00:37:02,280 --> 00:37:03,719
I don't care what happens.

395
00:37:04,400 --> 00:37:05,719
No matter what they say...

396
00:37:07,400 --> 00:37:09,399
...this tale will have a good ending.

397
00:37:10,240 --> 00:37:12,279
We promised each other, student.

398
00:37:15,200 --> 00:37:16,359
Come on.

399
00:37:16,880 --> 00:37:18,359
Someone will see.

400
00:37:18,720 --> 00:37:19,839
Come.

401
00:37:46,400 --> 00:37:47,639
Look at these.

402
00:37:48,320 --> 00:37:49,639
Look at these.

403
00:37:52,280 --> 00:37:54,799
All the people who lose themselves for it...

404
00:37:55,040 --> 00:37:56,519
...for this gold...

405
00:38:03,440 --> 00:38:04,519
Alaeddin tell me.

406
00:38:04,840 --> 00:38:05,559
My Bey.

407
00:38:06,720 --> 00:38:09,759
Do you think Imren will only accept the messenger?

408
00:38:11,040 --> 00:38:12,719
In return for Gunduz Bey..

409
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:15,719
...we'll give him the messengers and the cardinal.

410
00:38:17,440 --> 00:38:19,359
If he's smart he'll accept it.

411
00:38:20,400 --> 00:38:22,359
He's smart.

412
00:38:22,360 --> 00:38:24,359
He's even smarter than we thought.

413
00:38:26,400 --> 00:38:29,399
Gunduz Bey is important to us.

414
00:38:29,520 --> 00:38:31,399
We value him. But...

415
00:38:32,160 --> 00:38:33,959
...cardinal and the messengers...

416
00:38:34,560 --> 00:38:37,039
...don't mean anything for Imren.

417
00:38:37,080 --> 00:38:39,039
He's just a bug.

418
00:38:39,160 --> 00:38:41,039
He keeps them for the Pope.

419
00:38:44,320 --> 00:38:45,999
So I say...

420
00:38:47,000 --> 00:38:48,919
...he'll want the gold too.

421
00:38:50,360 --> 00:38:53,119
Then we will reveal..

422
00:38:53,120 --> 00:38:55,719
...our wagon full of fire.

423
00:38:55,720 --> 00:38:57,719
Right. Right. But...

424
00:39:00,240 --> 00:39:02,359
...we won't give them gold.

425
00:39:02,840 --> 00:39:04,799
We'll split the gold.

426
00:39:04,960 --> 00:39:07,279
A part of it will go to the tribe.

427
00:39:07,680 --> 00:39:10,639
The rest will go to secret
treasury under the lodge in Sogut.

428
00:39:13,640 --> 00:39:16,999
Baysungur and Aykurt will take on this duty.

429
00:39:18,520 --> 00:39:19,399
As you wish my Bey.

430
00:39:20,160 --> 00:39:21,639
No one will know.

431
00:39:25,440 --> 00:39:26,279
Bala.

432
00:39:27,240 --> 00:39:29,399
Let's ask our daughter again.

433
00:39:30,160 --> 00:39:32,399
She'll give us information on Atranos.

434
00:39:32,840 --> 00:39:34,559
We must have leverage.

435
00:39:35,440 --> 00:39:36,799
She'll do it for us.

436
00:39:37,880 --> 00:39:40,279
We'll know everything about Atranos.

437
00:39:40,920 --> 00:39:41,959
Alright.

438
00:39:42,440 --> 00:39:43,399
Alps.

439
00:39:44,120 --> 00:39:45,919
Everyone back to duty.

440
00:39:47,520 --> 00:39:49,279
Let's go. Bala.

441
00:39:56,960 --> 00:39:59,919
Carry the spears for the siege to the wagon.

442
00:40:00,520 --> 00:40:02,879
When the army's at the Atranos gates...

443
00:40:02,880 --> 00:40:05,079
...they'll use these spears okay?

444
00:40:05,200 --> 00:40:07,079
As you wish Malhun Hatun.

445
00:40:07,360 --> 00:40:08,519
Let's go.

446
00:40:09,800 --> 00:40:10,799
Ulgen.

447
00:40:11,240 --> 00:40:12,399
Malhun Hatun.

448
00:40:12,800 --> 00:40:13,999
I can't find Ayse Hatun.

449
00:40:14,080 --> 00:40:15,039
What do you mean?

450
00:40:15,640 --> 00:40:17,199
Didn't the Alps see them?

451
00:40:17,520 --> 00:40:19,719
No. We looked everywhere.

452
00:40:20,240 --> 00:40:22,319
I'm thinking of something.

453
00:40:23,240 --> 00:40:25,639
What if she followed Elcim Hatun?

454
00:40:26,280 --> 00:40:28,759
Maybe she sent crazy again.

455
00:40:28,760 --> 00:40:30,759
Don't think the worst Ulgen.

456
00:40:30,920 --> 00:40:32,759
We'd know if that were the case.

457
00:40:33,520 --> 00:40:35,439
Maybe she's taking a walk.

458
00:40:35,480 --> 00:40:37,359
Send Alps to look for her.

459
00:40:37,440 --> 00:40:38,279
Okay then.

460
00:40:42,560 --> 00:40:43,559
Malhun Hatun.

461
00:40:44,200 --> 00:40:45,399
What is it?

462
00:40:48,040 --> 00:40:49,719
Send Osman Beymy regards.

463
00:40:49,760 --> 00:40:51,759
Peace.be upon you.

464
00:40:51,760 --> 00:40:54,079
It's important.
About Candaroglu.

465
00:40:54,480 --> 00:40:55,439
Thank you.

466
00:41:09,400 --> 00:41:11,079
This would ruin us all.

467
00:41:13,400 --> 00:41:14,599
My Allah!

468
00:41:15,560 --> 00:41:17,079
They'll track us down soon.

469
00:41:17,560 --> 00:41:19,319
Hurry up.

470
00:41:23,120 --> 00:41:25,519
If we leave they'll know we
know about the passages.

471
00:41:26,480 --> 00:41:27,839
My father would be killed.

472
00:41:28,760 --> 00:41:30,439
If we stay, we might not survive.

473
00:41:31,680 --> 00:41:35,159
Our fathers rode to an unknown once, Elcim Hatun.

474
00:41:35,320 --> 00:41:35,919
Right?

475
00:41:36,720 --> 00:41:41,159
You seem softer ever since
your father was captured.

476
00:41:50,160 --> 00:41:51,319
feel anxious Orhan Bey.

477
00:41:51,840 --> 00:41:52,599
And...

478
00:41:54,520 --> 00:41:55,919
...It's not just about my father.

479
00:41:59,040 --> 00:42:01,119
Tell me Elcim Hatun.

480
00:42:01,400 --> 00:42:03,119
What is it?

481
00:42:12,520 --> 00:42:14,719
We don't have much time left until the wedding.

482
00:42:15,040 --> 00:42:17,839
I don't want there to be any secrets between us.

483
00:42:18,800 --> 00:42:21,639
The one who burned the dowry was Ayca.

484
00:42:23,280 --> 00:42:26,479
Do you think they will be ready
until the wedding, Malhun Hatun?

485
00:42:26,560 --> 00:42:27,919
We have lots to do.

486
00:42:27,920 --> 00:42:29,439
Maybe we should postpone the wedding.

487
00:42:29,480 --> 00:42:32,199
They will be done girl.

488
00:42:32,920 --> 00:42:35,519
Why would Ayca Hatun do that?

489
00:42:35,520 --> 00:42:37,559
Because of that poison.

490
00:42:37,680 --> 00:42:41,679
My sister in law is getting
worse instead of better.

491
00:42:41,960 --> 00:42:44,079
Holofira.

492
00:42:44,840 --> 00:42:47,759
She died because of that poison too.

493
00:42:51,640 --> 00:42:54,039
This might be happening because of her.

494
00:42:54,160 --> 00:42:55,719
Elcim Hatun.

495
00:42:55,840 --> 00:42:57,439
You just said that...

496
00:42:57,440 --> 00:43:00,119
...there shouldn't be any secrets between us.

497
00:43:00,320 --> 00:43:01,799
You're right.

498
00:43:01,920 --> 00:43:03,439
My father played a game.

499
00:43:03,440 --> 00:43:06,639
From the very start we knew that Olivia was guilty.

500
00:43:06,640 --> 00:43:10,199
But to learn where the hidden
passages were at Atranos...

501
00:43:10,200 --> 00:43:12,679
...we made it look like Holofira died...

502
00:43:12,680 --> 00:43:14,839
...and played Olivia.

503
00:43:14,840 --> 00:43:17,479
After we found out where the passages were...

504
00:43:17,480 --> 00:43:20,719
...we were going to tell everyone the truth.

505
00:43:21,000 --> 00:43:22,919
Thank Allah.

506
00:43:23,280 --> 00:43:25,719
Aren't you mad that we...

507
00:43:25,880 --> 00:43:27,679
...kept the truth from you?

508
00:43:28,160 --> 00:43:29,639
On the contrary.

509
00:43:29,640 --> 00:43:33,319
I'm happy that I didn't have the
blood of an innocent on my hands.

510
00:43:33,760 --> 00:43:35,839
May Osman Bey live a long life.

511
00:43:35,840 --> 00:43:38,239
He showed us how great he is once again.

512
00:43:38,240 --> 00:43:40,039
It's alright, Elcim Hatun.

513
00:43:40,040 --> 00:43:43,468
You're worthy to be the
bride to be to this beyhood with

514
00:43:43,480 --> 00:43:46,919
your consciousness, fairness
and pure heart, Elcim Hatun.

515
00:43:48,320 --> 00:43:50,599
Is Holofira okay?

516
00:43:52,560 --> 00:43:54,039
She is.

517
00:43:57,640 --> 00:44:00,199
...said our goodbyes to each other.

518
00:44:00,520 --> 00:44:02,999
From now on..

519
00:44:03,800 --> 00:44:06,279
...Holofira will walk her own path...

520
00:44:07,280 --> 00:44:09,599
...and I will walk my own.

521
00:44:14,800 --> 00:44:16,799
My Shahzade, they're coming.

522
00:44:16,800 --> 00:44:18,519
Everyone to their positions, come on.

523
00:44:18,520 --> 00:44:19,799
Come on.

524
00:44:29,880 --> 00:44:32,639
Are you looking for me?

525
00:44:33,520 --> 00:44:36,679
The one who is looking for her will find me or...

526
00:44:36,960 --> 00:44:39,239
...their end.

527
00:44:40,200 --> 00:44:41,919
Pull it.

528
00:44:46,280 --> 00:44:48,559
Come on alps.

529
00:45:09,560 --> 00:45:12,479
7, 8, 9...

530
00:45:12,880 --> 00:45:15,079
One missing.

531
00:45:25,640 --> 00:45:28,759
May Allah take mercy on the enemy, right?

532
00:45:29,680 --> 00:45:31,399
Won't we hide them?

533
00:45:31,400 --> 00:45:35,559
Before they find these bodies,
we will have already taken Atranos.

534
00:45:35,960 --> 00:45:37,879
Come on.

535
00:45:41,000 --> 00:45:43,479
Osman Bey is coming.

536
00:45:44,280 --> 00:45:46,399
-My bey...
-Long live Osman Bey.

537
00:45:46,400 --> 00:45:48,399
-Thank you Osman Bey.
-Long live Osman Bey.

538
00:45:48,400 --> 00:45:50,759
-Long live Osman Bey.
-Osman Bey.

539
00:46:00,480 --> 00:46:02,679
Congrats on your victory, father.

540
00:46:02,680 --> 00:46:04,239
Thank you.

541
00:46:04,240 --> 00:46:06,519
Thank you my beautiful daughter.

542
00:46:07,360 --> 00:46:08,839
Welcome son.

543
00:46:08,840 --> 00:46:10,639
Thank you mother.

544
00:46:10,920 --> 00:46:12,639
Welcome my bey.

545
00:46:14,960 --> 00:46:16,759
What is it?

546
00:46:17,120 --> 00:46:18,159
My bey.

547
00:46:18,760 --> 00:46:21,279
I have news but...

548
00:46:22,760 --> 00:46:24,559
...it's bad.

549
00:47:01,040 --> 00:47:02,999
Don't go, son.

550
00:47:24,040 --> 00:47:28,159
You see, Gunduz Bey, you
sacrificed yourself for Osman Bey...

551
00:47:28,320 --> 00:47:31,599
...but he sent his men to me out of fear.

552
00:47:36,760 --> 00:47:39,519
And a dead man.

553
00:47:44,600 --> 00:47:46,799
How are you still alive?

554
00:47:48,560 --> 00:47:52,639
Well, Allah has not taken my life, Imren Tegin.

555
00:47:56,040 --> 00:47:59,639
Maybe you are not powerful enough to kill me.

556
00:48:01,920 --> 00:48:04,959
What does your weak Bey want from me?

557
00:48:05,760 --> 00:48:08,839
You really don't know us.

558
00:48:09,280 --> 00:48:13,359
Weakness is what suits you...

559
00:48:13,680 --> 00:48:16,959
...not Osman Bey.

560
00:48:17,360 --> 00:48:20,399
Speak before I cut off your tongue.

561
00:48:20,680 --> 00:48:24,439
Or do you want to hang there
together with Gunduz Bey?

562
00:48:25,480 --> 00:48:26,959
Turahan.

563
00:48:30,720 --> 00:48:33,199
There won't be 3 people this time.

564
00:48:34,040 --> 00:48:37,999
But we came not to talk, but to talk.

565
00:48:38,240 --> 00:48:41,999
We are messengers. Control your anger.

566
00:48:46,160 --> 00:48:49,759
Now, do you know why...

567
00:48:49,760 --> 00:48:52,519
...I call you weak? Let me explain.

568
00:48:52,920 --> 00:48:56,599
You worked together with crusaders and the pope.

569
00:48:56,760 --> 00:49:01,199
But you couldn't defend the frontier market

570
00:49:01,880 --> 00:49:05,119
You couldn't protect the ambassadors.

571
00:49:05,920 --> 00:49:09,079
You couldn't protect the Cardinal.

572
00:49:11,160 --> 00:49:14,039
So you are ashamed in front of the whole West...

573
00:49:14,720 --> 00:49:18,639
...and everyone that worked with you were failed.

574
00:49:27,240 --> 00:49:30,559
Then there is no need for Gunduz Bey to live.

575
00:49:30,720 --> 00:49:32,879
Don't!

576
00:49:34,160 --> 00:49:37,159
I am not finished yet.

577
00:49:39,720 --> 00:49:41,479
Turahan.

578
00:49:48,160 --> 00:49:51,359
Cardinal is alive.

579
00:49:56,840 --> 00:49:58,639
Thank Allah.

580
00:49:58,640 --> 00:50:03,519
Osman Bey made me proud even when I am a prisoner!

581
00:50:11,440 --> 00:50:14,159
Do you think you will get away with this?

582
00:50:17,440 --> 00:50:20,079
Taking the Cardinal as prisoner, huh?

583
00:50:21,040 --> 00:50:26,159
You are confusing papacy
with the Tekfurs you fight!

584
00:50:27,360 --> 00:50:31,999
Well, the pope and the
tekfurs are all the same for us.

585
00:50:33,280 --> 00:50:36,479
An infidel is an infidel.

586
00:50:45,240 --> 00:50:46,959
Now...

587
00:50:48,240 --> 00:50:50,079
...shall we talk?

588
00:50:55,520 --> 00:50:59,759
For whom do I fight?

589
00:51:01,560 --> 00:51:05,999
They try to make treacherous
plans and hit us from behind.

590
00:51:09,400 --> 00:51:14,479
While I am fighting in the front against the
Byzantine, they try to stab us in the back!

591
00:51:16,080 --> 00:51:20,319
So this alliance was the
reason for Gonca to be married...

592
00:51:21,000 --> 00:51:23,999
...to Candaroglu.

593
00:51:24,600 --> 00:51:27,399
Germiyan and Candars are getting united.

594
00:51:28,640 --> 00:51:30,919
They even set a goal ahead.

595
00:51:31,440 --> 00:51:35,319
They are going to take Mekece
so I couldn't conquer Bursa.

596
00:51:35,720 --> 00:51:39,279
First Mekece, and the forts around it.

597
00:51:39,640 --> 00:51:42,959
That way, they will set a border
between me and Byzantine.

598
00:51:43,360 --> 00:51:47,199
Their goal is to...

599
00:51:48,640 --> 00:51:51,039
...stop me from conquering Bursa!

600
00:51:51,520 --> 00:51:54,199
They want to stop my conquests.

601
00:51:54,920 --> 00:51:58,279
But Yakup Bey looked as a
good man while he was leaving.

602
00:51:58,720 --> 00:52:02,519
You were right to not give him your blessing.

603
00:52:03,840 --> 00:52:07,119
If I killed them
I would be right.

604
00:52:07,160 --> 00:52:08,559
Would I? Tell me.

605
00:52:10,680 --> 00:52:11,719
But...

606
00:52:12,560 --> 00:52:13,839
But...

607
00:52:14,080 --> 00:52:16,399
I won't let them stop me.

608
00:52:18,080 --> 00:52:19,319
You talk of blood..

609
00:52:20,040 --> 00:52:21,919
...but it's not just about alliance.

610
00:52:22,840 --> 00:52:25,559
Gonca and Alaeddin are in love.

611
00:52:25,560 --> 00:52:27,039
Their hearts belong together.

612
00:52:27,040 --> 00:52:29,519
What heart are you talking of?

613
00:52:29,640 --> 00:52:30,919
The homeland is at risk.

614
00:52:31,640 --> 00:52:32,919
No.

615
00:52:35,480 --> 00:52:37,719
What must be will be.

616
00:52:39,840 --> 00:52:41,079
What must be...

617
00:52:44,920 --> 00:52:47,679
Osman wants Gunduz Bey in return for cardinal?

618
00:52:47,960 --> 00:52:48,879
That's right.

619
00:52:50,120 --> 00:52:53,719
Let's talk with nice manners.

620
00:52:55,280 --> 00:52:58,719
Let's do our business. But seeing him like this..

621
00:52:58,920 --> 00:53:02,679
They'll make you pay for what you did.

622
00:53:03,080 --> 00:53:03,839
But...

623
00:53:03,880 --> 00:53:05,999
You kept yelling Imren.

624
00:53:08,440 --> 00:53:09,879
What happened?

625
00:53:10,080 --> 00:53:13,119
Did Osman Bey stop your breath?

626
00:53:16,800 --> 00:53:19,159
Shut up!
-Enough!

627
00:53:21,720 --> 00:53:22,639
Not enough!

628
00:53:27,240 --> 00:53:29,199
You'll lose everything Imren.

629
00:53:29,960 --> 00:53:32,239
Gunduz Bey;'s important to you right?

630
00:53:36,680 --> 00:53:38,479
Not just cardinal.

631
00:53:39,240 --> 00:53:41,599
I want the cardinal, messengers...

632
00:53:41,760 --> 00:53:44,279
...and Olcaytu's gold.

633
00:53:47,280 --> 00:53:48,319
But...

634
00:53:48,320 --> 00:53:49,759
you don't..

635
00:53:49,920 --> 00:53:52,679
...tell Osman, he an kill the cardinal.

636
00:53:54,040 --> 00:53:54,879
And I...

637
00:53:56,080 --> 00:53:59,279
..will send Gunduz Bey's head as a wedding gift.

638
00:54:04,840 --> 00:54:06,359
Osman Bey;..

639
00:54:06,560 --> 00:54:08,399
can't bargain with him...

640
00:54:08,400 --> 00:54:11,319
...with this dog for me.

641
00:54:11,680 --> 00:54:14,439
Don't make him make this dog happy.

642
00:54:15,840 --> 00:54:18,319
If our enemy laughs...

643
00:54:19,360 --> 00:54:23,279
...he must have lost half his teeth Gunduz Bey.

644
00:54:25,880 --> 00:54:26,999
Don't worry.

645
00:54:31,640 --> 00:54:33,159
...will tell my Bey.

646
00:54:33,760 --> 00:54:34,479
And...

647
00:54:35,480 --> 00:54:36,599
...he'll decide.

648
00:54:39,800 --> 00:54:40,879
Now get out of here.

649
00:54:43,320 --> 00:54:44,399
Allah Allah.

650
00:54:46,240 --> 00:54:47,679
Allah Allah.

651
00:55:03,440 --> 00:55:06,639
First the troops, then the crusaders base is gone.

652
00:55:08,320 --> 00:55:09,519
Osman's coming to us.

653
00:55:11,040 --> 00:55:12,399
What will we do now?

654
00:55:12,600 --> 00:55:14,399
Cities can be conquered Olivia.

655
00:55:14,760 --> 00:55:17,839
What matters is the cardinal
and the messengers to live.

656
00:55:18,200 --> 00:55:21,079
Or all our allies will attack us.

657
00:55:23,120 --> 00:55:24,399
Osman can't know.

658
00:55:26,520 --> 00:55:27,599
He won't.

659
00:55:29,600 --> 00:55:31,679
He'll give me what I want for Gunduz Bey.

660
00:55:32,280 --> 00:55:33,679
He has to.

661
00:55:35,520 --> 00:55:36,999
I'll get what I want...

662
00:55:37,800 --> 00:55:38,959
...then I'll kill Osman.

663
00:55:51,360 --> 00:55:52,679
Peace be with you.

664
00:55:52,760 --> 00:55:54,679
Peace be upon you.

665
00:55:57,320 --> 00:56:00,159
Thank Allah. I was scared that you're late.

666
00:56:01,480 --> 00:56:02,919
Son. Are you okay?

667
00:56:03,720 --> 00:56:05,919
We're okay mother. Thank Allah.

668
00:56:06,640 --> 00:56:07,799
Good. Elcim?

669
00:56:08,320 --> 00:56:09,399
Are you okay?

670
00:56:09,880 --> 00:56:10,759
I'm okay.

671
00:56:11,160 --> 00:56:12,079
Good.

672
00:56:12,800 --> 00:56:14,639
Did you find out where the passages are?

673
00:56:15,360 --> 00:56:16,799
We did. Thank Allah.

674
00:56:19,920 --> 00:56:21,239
But Gunduz Bey...

675
00:56:21,920 --> 00:56:23,799
...fell captive to Imren Tegin.

676
00:56:23,960 --> 00:56:25,559
We know son.

677
00:56:25,600 --> 00:56:27,839
My girl. Stay strong.

678
00:56:28,200 --> 00:56:29,820
We know the passages.

679
00:56:29,820 --> 00:56:33,069
We'll get your father out of there
safe and sound, if Allah permits.

680
00:56:33,069 --> 00:56:34,929
I know Mother Malhun.

681
00:56:35,160 --> 00:56:36,679
I can't stop it though.

682
00:56:38,160 --> 00:56:39,199
Mother.

683
00:56:39,880 --> 00:56:41,199
I'll let father know.

684
00:56:42,280 --> 00:56:43,199
Be careful.

685
00:56:48,000 --> 00:56:48,719
My girl.

686
00:56:50,080 --> 00:56:52,319
I didn't want to say it now but...

687
00:56:52,600 --> 00:56:55,719
...no one's seen Ayca in a while.

688
00:56:57,240 --> 00:56:58,199
Is she lost?

689
00:57:00,000 --> 00:57:02,199
We looked everywhere but we can't find her.

690
00:57:02,640 --> 00:57:06,319
We thought she went with you.

691
00:57:08,000 --> 00:57:09,639
Malhun Hatun.

692
00:57:09,640 --> 00:57:14,119
While I was watching Olivia's tent at
night, Ayca Hatun was walking around it.

693
00:57:14,200 --> 00:57:16,439
No we checked it.

694
00:57:16,440 --> 00:57:18,439
Let's check again.

695
00:57:18,520 --> 00:57:20,399
Come on then.

696
00:57:26,160 --> 00:57:29,759
We finally succeeded right my Shahzade?

697
00:57:31,360 --> 00:57:34,719
This cart will give us a lot Samil.

698
00:57:35,160 --> 00:57:37,519
First, Gunduz Bey...

699
00:57:37,520 --> 00:57:39,599
...and then the Atranos Castle.

700
00:57:39,600 --> 00:57:42,279
And Imren's head.

701
00:57:45,120 --> 00:57:46,999
Did you place the fire?

702
00:57:47,000 --> 00:57:48,279
We did, my bey.

703
00:57:48,280 --> 00:57:51,439
There's dust fire even in the wheels of the cart.

704
00:57:51,960 --> 00:57:54,759
There will be a big explosion at Atranos.

705
00:57:55,960 --> 00:57:58,199
It will be so big that...

706
00:57:58,200 --> 00:58:01,679
...they'll hear it even from Constantinople.

707
00:58:03,160 --> 00:58:05,199
Alaeddin.

708
00:58:05,200 --> 00:58:06,879
Explain it to me.

709
00:58:06,880 --> 00:58:08,999
Okay my bey.

710
00:58:09,240 --> 00:58:13,279
We placed dust fire everywhere
in the skeleton of the cart.

711
00:58:13,440 --> 00:58:16,759
Nothing can be seen on the outside.

712
00:58:18,280 --> 00:58:21,799
The last chest will be place right here my bey.

713
00:58:21,800 --> 00:58:24,439
Once this connects with the lit fuse...

714
00:58:24,440 --> 00:58:28,159
...the infidels of Atranos will
resemble birds in the sky, my bey.

715
00:58:28,400 --> 00:58:31,679
We said we'll make him sit at a branch like a bird.

716
00:58:31,800 --> 00:58:34,399
He can't step on the floor.

717
00:58:34,800 --> 00:58:37,959
They're going to fly.

718
00:58:38,280 --> 00:58:41,439
But I don't want any mistakes
with this, just so you know.

719
00:58:41,440 --> 00:58:42,879
Okay my bey.

720
00:58:48,200 --> 00:58:48,879
My bey.

721
00:58:48,880 --> 00:58:50,519
Son.

722
00:58:52,240 --> 00:58:54,999
We figured out where the hidden
passages of Imren Tegin are, my bey.

723
00:58:55,000 --> 00:58:57,919
Oh priase be!!

724
00:58:59,280 --> 00:59:03,279
When sons fulfill their duties like this...

725
00:59:03,280 --> 00:59:06,159
...victory becomes unavoidable as well.

726
00:59:08,720 --> 00:59:10,839
Listen to me well.

727
00:59:11,040 --> 00:59:14,079
Imren doesn't know that we know
about the hidden passages, so...

728
00:59:14,680 --> 00:59:18,439
...we're going to take Gunduz
Bey after we give the envoys to him.

729
00:59:19,160 --> 00:59:21,999
This cart which will be full
off gold will enter Atranos.

730
00:59:22,000 --> 00:59:24,679
We will wait at the hidden
passages when that is happening.

731
00:59:24,680 --> 00:59:26,079
Then..

732
00:59:26,720 --> 00:59:29,399
...after this cart is inside the walls...

733
00:59:29,680 --> 00:59:32,879
...there will be a big explosion.

734
00:59:35,920 --> 00:59:37,519
Will it be during the day my bey?

735
00:59:37,520 --> 00:59:41,359
Yes, if you take Kayi's Gunduz Bey's captive...

736
00:59:41,360 --> 00:59:44,839
...then we will blow up your castle in the
middle of the day like this, right Samil?

737
00:59:46,080 --> 00:59:50,039
In the middle of the day, yes.
When are confused by this...

738
00:59:50,040 --> 00:59:53,239
...we will attack them.

739
00:59:53,240 --> 00:59:54,719
Alright my Bey.

740
00:59:54,720 --> 00:59:56,359
If Allah permits, my Bey.

741
01:00:03,560 --> 01:00:07,199
We found the hidden
passages thanks to Holofira's act.

742
01:00:07,560 --> 01:00:09,599
Of course, this had to remain hidden.

743
01:00:09,600 --> 01:00:12,679
I understand it, I didn't take offense at all.

744
01:00:13,880 --> 01:00:16,519
My great bride, thank you.

745
01:00:16,520 --> 01:00:18,239
But you know this right?

746
01:00:18,240 --> 01:00:20,439
Even though Olivia left,
this is still a secret. Ayca...

747
01:00:20,440 --> 01:00:22,639
I will never tell her.

748
01:00:22,640 --> 01:00:26,159
I can't trust her while she's like this anyways.

749
01:00:26,560 --> 01:00:28,079
Mother Malhun.

750
01:00:28,080 --> 01:00:30,799
Ayca is the one who started the fire.

751
01:00:30,800 --> 01:00:32,759
What are you saying Elcim?

752
01:00:32,760 --> 01:00:35,079
But it's all because of that poison.

753
01:00:35,280 --> 01:00:38,959
She lost her mind, if it wasn't
for that she wouldn't have done it.

754
01:00:40,320 --> 01:00:43,439
I fear she might do something to herself now.

755
01:00:43,440 --> 01:00:46,679
We're going to find her, don't worry.

756
01:00:46,800 --> 01:00:49,599
Then we will be more careful for her safety.

757
01:00:49,600 --> 01:00:51,039
Come on.

758
01:00:52,760 --> 01:00:54,559
Ayca...

759
01:00:59,680 --> 01:01:02,199
She wanted to kill Olivia the moment she saw her.

760
01:01:02,200 --> 01:01:03,959
Hold on don't worry.

761
01:01:03,960 --> 01:01:05,119
We're going to find her.

762
01:01:05,120 --> 01:01:08,079
I have a very bad feeling.

763
01:01:09,560 --> 01:01:11,679
Allah Allah...

764
01:01:22,200 --> 01:01:23,719
What's that?

765
01:01:32,360 --> 01:01:33,919
No...

766
01:01:56,280 --> 01:01:57,919
Elcim, girl...

767
01:02:06,400 --> 01:02:08,439
She killed her...

768
01:02:08,440 --> 01:02:11,359
She killed my sister in law...

769
01:02:12,320 --> 01:02:17,039
She was left to us by my brother!

770
01:02:20,840 --> 01:02:23,039
-Orhan.
-Mother.

771
01:02:23,240 --> 01:02:24,959
What is going on?

772
01:02:40,840 --> 01:02:45,199
I swear I am going to kill Olivia with my hands.

773
01:02:46,760 --> 01:02:48,159
We will take her revenge.

774
01:02:48,160 --> 01:02:50,879
I am going to kill her.

775
01:02:50,880 --> 01:02:52,719
We will take her revenge.

776
01:03:05,560 --> 01:03:07,999
We will take the gold here.

777
01:03:08,240 --> 01:03:12,639
When they pass through here,
we will take it somewhere safe.

778
01:03:52,040 --> 01:03:54,039
Look at you.

779
01:03:56,080 --> 01:03:58,959
Now you are gathering men against my men!?

780
01:04:03,680 --> 01:04:06,479
You couldn't be exiled honorably?

781
01:04:06,480 --> 01:04:07,799
Boran.

782
01:04:08,840 --> 01:04:12,119
We fought, we paid the price, and it's over.

783
01:04:12,120 --> 01:04:14,719
They are all honorable*^
soldiers from Seljuk state.

784
01:04:15,040 --> 01:04:16,319
Know your place.

785
01:04:20,320 --> 01:04:21,599
Go away.

786
01:04:22,520 --> 01:04:24,999
You gather them around...

787
01:04:25,680 --> 01:04:28,199
...and stand against my Bey?

788
01:04:30,280 --> 01:04:32,399
I will not allow that!

789
01:04:35,720 --> 01:04:38,879
Are you going to do that alone?

790
01:04:42,040 --> 01:04:43,879
You speak like an enemy.

791
01:04:45,520 --> 01:04:47,679
So you will be my enemy.

792
01:04:49,120 --> 01:04:51,919
You won't listen to reason.

793
01:04:53,640 --> 01:04:55,919
Well, then you deserve a beating.

794
01:05:00,680 --> 01:05:02,079
Go on, brave ones!

795
01:05:02,360 --> 01:05:03,599
Come on

796
01:05:05,640 --> 01:05:06,799
Give it to me.

797
01:06:04,760 --> 01:06:06,879
What did he use to trick you?

798
01:06:06,880 --> 01:06:09,639
No one is tricked, we are
all following our own paths.

799
01:06:09,640 --> 01:06:12,319
But your path leads to death.

800
01:06:12,480 --> 01:06:15,799
I will die on the righteous path. lam sure of it.

801
01:06:15,960 --> 01:06:16,839
Come on!

802
01:07:17,960 --> 01:07:20,839
Priest sends is regards Jesus' soldiers.

803
01:07:21,640 --> 01:07:23,479
We're here to take the swords of church.

804
01:07:31,480 --> 01:07:34,959
This is it. Hurry, the units are coming.

805
01:07:45,960 --> 01:07:48,439
How did you know the church would receive swords?

806
01:07:48,800 --> 01:07:51,599
My aunt won't start a war
without the support of the church.

807
01:08:08,280 --> 01:08:10,679
These are Bursa Tekfur's soldiers.

808
01:08:17,880 --> 01:08:19,919
Ayca was a good girl.

809
01:08:20,279 --> 01:08:21,919
Olivia poisoned her...

810
01:08:22,200 --> 01:08:25,037
...then she died when she went crazy.

811
01:08:26,160 --> 01:08:28,439
Don't worry mother.

812
01:08:28,600 --> 01:08:30,439
They won't get away with it.

813
01:08:30,960 --> 01:08:32,439
Of course.

814
01:08:35,720 --> 01:08:38,679
Did you see Elcim after Ayca's funeral?

815
01:08:41,040 --> 01:08:41,639
Son.

816
01:08:42,200 --> 01:08:44,919
You'll marry Elcim eventually.

817
01:08:45,200 --> 01:08:48,439
She needs you at a time like this. See her.

818
01:08:49,200 --> 01:08:49,919
Mother.

819
01:08:50,800 --> 01:08:52,319
Elcim Hatun's strong.

820
01:08:52,439 --> 01:08:54,319
She'll get through it.

821
01:08:55,240 --> 01:08:57,479
Of course she will. She's strong.

822
01:08:58,080 --> 01:08:59,479
But her father's captive.

823
01:08:59,920 --> 01:09:01,278
Her aunt in law died.

824
01:09:01,279 --> 01:09:03,278
She has no one but you.

825
01:09:03,479 --> 01:09:04,559
Be with her.

826
01:09:06,760 --> 01:09:07,479
Okay.

827
01:09:08,479 --> 01:09:09,919
I'll go see her now.

828
01:09:20,240 --> 01:09:21,759
Stop. Who are you?

829
01:09:24,560 --> 01:09:26,118
Bala Hatun expects us.

830
01:09:26,200 --> 01:09:26,879
Pass.

831
01:09:39,000 --> 01:09:40,599
Son.

832
01:09:42,279 --> 01:09:43,158
My Bey.

833
01:09:44,960 --> 01:09:45,919
What are you doing?

834
01:09:46,520 --> 01:09:47,919
The wagon's ready my Bey.

835
01:09:48,319 --> 01:09:49,559
The system is functional.

836
01:09:49,720 --> 01:09:51,559
Everything's ready, thank Allah.

837
01:09:52,359 --> 01:09:53,559
Alright, alright.

838
01:09:54,279 --> 01:09:55,559
Imren can think about the rest.

839
01:09:55,880 --> 01:09:56,719
Right. Right.

840
01:09:57,240 --> 01:09:59,079
Yagiz Alp. Put on the lid.

841
01:10:05,840 --> 01:10:06,679
Father.

842
01:10:07,560 --> 01:10:09,719
If you have time I wish to talk.

843
01:10:18,840 --> 01:10:21,039
Tell me. What is it?

844
01:10:23,480 --> 01:10:24,319
Father.

845
01:10:27,320 --> 01:10:28,999
I want to marry Gonca Hatun.

846
01:10:32,200 --> 01:10:35,519
Gonca Hatun is a woman
worthy of our tribe and family.

847
01:10:36,040 --> 01:10:37,119
I vouch for her.

848
01:10:50,640 --> 01:10:52,199
Gonca is a good girl.

849
01:10:57,720 --> 01:10:58,759
But...

850
01:11:03,080 --> 01:11:04,359
...she's engaged son.

851
01:11:08,000 --> 01:11:09,999
Can you fight that?

852
01:11:11,480 --> 01:11:11,919
Can you?

853
01:11:13,520 --> 01:11:16,719
Can you brave this hard task Alaeddin Ali?

854
01:11:16,920 --> 01:11:18,719
I know my Bey.

855
01:11:19,080 --> 01:11:20,719
But I thought about it.

856
01:11:22,000 --> 01:11:24,519
I'm willing to fight this battle for love.

857
01:11:33,080 --> 01:11:35,399
Germiyanids won't allow this marriage.

858
01:11:39,000 --> 01:11:39,959
What about Gonca?

859
01:11:42,840 --> 01:11:43,839
Can she...

860
01:11:44,560 --> 01:11:46,119
...stand against her family?

861
01:11:47,960 --> 01:11:49,559
Gonca wants this my Bey.

862
01:11:50,240 --> 01:11:51,559
We set out together.

863
01:11:57,840 --> 01:11:58,919
Look son.

864
01:11:59,360 --> 01:12:00,359
Your brother Orhan.

865
01:12:01,440 --> 01:12:03,639
For the future of our beyhood..

866
01:12:04,080 --> 01:12:05,639
..he gave up on his love.

867
01:12:07,120 --> 01:12:08,239
And now you...

868
01:12:10,600 --> 01:12:12,759
...for the future of our beyhood...

869
01:12:17,480 --> 01:12:19,519
You're going to marry Gonca.

870
01:12:20,400 --> 01:12:22,199
Allah.

871
01:12:23,160 --> 01:12:24,519
Allah.

872
01:12:27,880 --> 01:12:29,199
Allah.

873
01:12:32,280 --> 01:12:33,839
That's all Bala Hatun.

874
01:12:33,960 --> 01:12:36,839
Imren Tegin got support from Bursa.

875
01:12:36,840 --> 01:12:40,399
They're going to wait in case of
a possible attack inside the castle.

876
01:12:40,400 --> 01:12:42,639
So that it huh?

877
01:12:42,960 --> 01:12:44,439
Okay.

878
01:12:44,440 --> 01:12:50,039
Thanks to you we know everything
about the trap they tried to set.

879
01:12:50,760 --> 01:12:53,879
You helped us so much...

880
01:12:53,880 --> 01:12:56,119
Thank you.

881
01:12:57,160 --> 01:12:59,781
You reminded me of the
kindness of my mother

882
01:12:59,793 --> 01:13:02,719
whose voice I can't even
remember now, Bala Hatun.

883
01:13:02,840 --> 01:13:05,319
It's not even enough.

884
01:13:05,520 --> 01:13:08,679
I want your victory more than anything.

885
01:13:09,160 --> 01:13:11,919
Not just for myself either.

886
01:13:11,920 --> 01:13:14,799
I want it for all the oppressed people.

887
01:13:15,640 --> 01:13:18,359
I want people like Olivia and Imren Tegin not to...

888
01:13:18,360 --> 01:13:22,039
...die before they experience
what they made others experience.

889
01:13:24,200 --> 01:13:26,639
Don't worry girl.

890
01:13:26,800 --> 01:13:31,639
Those cruel people will get their
share from Osman Bey's justice.

891
01:13:32,240 --> 01:13:36,319
Until then you'll stay at the tribe, with us.

892
01:13:36,400 --> 01:13:38,799
For your safety.

893
01:13:39,520 --> 01:13:41,879
Okay then.

894
01:13:46,320 --> 01:13:48,799
Can I come in Elcim Hatun?

895
01:13:56,960 --> 01:13:59,479
Come in Orhan Bey.

896
01:14:07,480 --> 01:14:08,879
Elcim Hatun.

897
01:14:08,880 --> 01:14:11,639
I know you want to be alone...

898
01:14:12,240 --> 01:14:15,039
...but I'm worried about you.

899
01:14:15,880 --> 01:14:18,159
Thank you.

900
01:14:18,760 --> 01:14:21,359
But I can't stop thinking about my aunt.

901
01:14:22,320 --> 01:14:25,439
We went through so much together...

902
01:14:25,840 --> 01:14:28,239
You're a very strong woman.

903
01:14:28,240 --> 01:14:31,719
I know that but you shouldn't
hide your pain from me.

904
01:14:31,880 --> 01:14:34,199
We're one now.

905
01:14:41,560 --> 01:14:43,799
Cry Elcim Hatun.

906
01:14:43,960 --> 01:14:45,799
Cry, it will help.

907
01:14:56,840 --> 01:14:59,399
I don't want to
believe it Orhan Bey.

908
01:14:59,400 --> 01:15:02,159
My father is captive at the hands of the enemy.

909
01:15:02,440 --> 01:15:05,359
My sister in law was murdered...

910
01:15:08,160 --> 01:15:10,399
What kind of a test is this?

911
01:15:10,600 --> 01:15:13,559
I'm not complaining, may Allah forgive.

912
01:15:14,080 --> 01:15:17,199
But I will kill Olivia with my bare hands.

913
01:15:17,200 --> 01:15:20,279
From now on, your pain is my pain.

914
01:15:20,280 --> 01:15:22,999
Your revenge is my revenge.

915
01:15:23,000 --> 01:15:26,679
But just know this. The
revenge you're wishing for...

916
01:15:26,760 --> 01:15:29,239
...is not that far away.

917
01:15:30,120 --> 01:15:33,559
We figured out where the
hidden passages are at Atranos.

918
01:15:33,680 --> 01:15:36,479
Now, we have the upper hand right?

919
01:15:37,280 --> 01:15:39,279
Thank Allah.

920
01:15:39,880 --> 01:15:44,199
But I know that, if I have the
hope to reunite with my father now...

921
01:15:44,560 --> 01:15:47,639
...it's all thanks to Holofira acting dead.

922
01:15:48,440 --> 01:15:51,439
If not we couldn't have find the passages.

923
01:15:51,840 --> 01:15:54,559
I owe her an apology.

924
01:15:55,560 --> 01:15:58,879
Holofira has a big heart, Elcim Hatun.

925
01:15:59,880 --> 01:16:02,799
She must've understood your reasoning on her own.

926
01:16:03,840 --> 01:16:07,159
But don't think about these things now.

927
01:16:07,680 --> 01:16:09,759
Rest well.

928
01:16:10,120 --> 01:16:12,479
Tomorrow will be a hard day.

929
01:16:12,680 --> 01:16:14,839
Excuse me.

930
01:16:29,000 --> 01:16:31,799
May Allah protect you, Elcim Hatun.

931
01:16:32,080 --> 01:16:36,239
Once the sun raises we will take both
Atranos and Gunduz Bey, if Allah permits.

932
01:16:36,240 --> 01:16:37,599
If Allah permits.

933
01:16:57,600 --> 01:16:59,919
Who is there?

934
01:17:13,720 --> 01:17:15,799
Holofira.

935
01:17:24,400 --> 01:17:27,959
I brought information about Atranos.

936
01:17:29,400 --> 01:17:32,239
Bala Hatun asked me to
stay here until the conquest.

937
01:17:32,360 --> 01:17:35,039
-I couldn't disobey her.
-Okay.

938
01:17:38,880 --> 01:17:40,639
You did well.

939
01:17:42,480 --> 01:17:44,559
Mother Bala thought well.

940
01:17:47,840 --> 01:17:51,599
But I don't want to bother anyone.

941
01:17:53,360 --> 01:17:55,879
I won't come out of my tent either.

942
01:18:01,440 --> 01:18:04,599
Elcim Hatun, you must have heard...

943
01:18:05,120 --> 01:18:09,039
...Imren Tegin imprisoned Gunduz Bey.

944
01:18:09,320 --> 01:18:12,079
And her sister Ayca passed away.

945
01:18:12,680 --> 01:18:15,079
She is devastated.

946
01:18:17,280 --> 01:18:18,519
That's why, I...

947
01:18:18,520 --> 01:18:21,479
You will get married soon.

948
01:18:23,080 --> 01:18:25,559
You should be with her.

949
01:18:30,040 --> 01:18:31,679
I am so sorry about it.

950
01:18:32,200 --> 01:18:34,959
Bala Hatun told me everything.

951
01:18:35,600 --> 01:18:38,159
I hope my aunt will get her punishment.

952
01:18:43,680 --> 01:18:45,319
What about you?

953
01:18:46,800 --> 01:18:49,399
How are you, Holofira?

954
01:18:56,640 --> 01:18:59,319
Your tent is ready, Holofira Hatun.

955
01:19:02,760 --> 01:19:05,119
I am as how you
left me, Orhan Bey.

956
01:19:06,120 --> 01:19:07,519
I am fine.

957
01:19:08,800 --> 01:19:10,959
And I will get better.

958
01:19:14,000 --> 01:19:16,439
Now, excuse me.

959
01:19:43,520 --> 01:19:47,919
I don't understand, father. What
does this mean? Did I hear you right?

960
01:19:51,680 --> 01:19:55,479
Yeah, you heard me right.

961
01:19:55,480 --> 01:19:56,519
Father.

962
01:19:57,480 --> 01:19:59,799
-You heard me right.
-Father!

963
01:20:03,120 --> 01:20:05,519
Alaeddin Ali.

964
01:20:10,600 --> 01:20:11,599
Look...

965
01:20:12,240 --> 01:20:15,959
...I knew there was something wrong
with this marriage since the beginning.

966
01:20:16,120 --> 01:20:19,079
And I was right. Mehmet Bey...

967
01:20:19,560 --> 01:20:21,679
...his attitude in the divan.

968
01:20:21,920 --> 01:20:23,799
It was obvious.

969
01:20:23,800 --> 01:20:27,679
You see, son, it's not always
the infidels that cause fitna.

970
01:20:27,720 --> 01:20:32,239
Our brothers started causing it too.

971
01:20:34,480 --> 01:20:36,679
What's with their treachery, my Bey?

972
01:20:40,120 --> 01:20:42,039
Germiyan and Candaroglu.

973
01:20:42,560 --> 01:20:45,799
They want to stop us by making an alliance.

974
01:20:46,280 --> 01:20:50,319
To stop the conquest of Bursa and Iznik...

975
01:20:53,400 --> 01:20:56,079
...they set Mekece as their goals.

976
01:20:56,560 --> 01:21:00,439
And they even sent a messenger
to the commander of the castle.

977
01:21:01,760 --> 01:21:04,119
What's their goal, my Bey?

978
01:21:05,000 --> 01:21:06,439
More than just conquest?

979
01:21:08,080 --> 01:21:12,199
Mekece has nothing to do with
conquest. It's not even in their path.

980
01:21:13,680 --> 01:21:17,199
Then you are telling me that they
want to settle in Byzantine borders...

981
01:21:17,520 --> 01:21:20,319
...and stop us from advancing, huh?

982
01:21:21,200 --> 01:21:23,359
We will understand what they want.

983
01:21:23,600 --> 01:21:26,359
And we will make our move accordingly.

984
01:21:26,840 --> 01:21:28,879
How are we going to know that, my Bey?

985
01:21:30,400 --> 01:21:32,639
Well, they are

986
01:21:32,880 --> 01:21:36,479
Now, they will come to the wedding of...

987
01:21:36,880 --> 01:21:39,199
...the son of great Osman Bey, Orhan Bey.

988
01:21:39,200 --> 01:21:41,639
They will want to look good.

989
01:21:42,800 --> 01:21:45,599
There we will understand their intentions.

990
01:21:45,920 --> 01:21:50,679
But, the marriage they want won't happen.

991
01:21:50,880 --> 01:21:52,519
Never.

992
01:21:54,480 --> 01:21:56,439
As you command, my Bey.

993
01:22:06,760 --> 01:22:09,079
Now...

994
01:22:10,240 --> 01:22:13,719
...you are thinking that if this
wasn't a political marriage...

995
01:22:13,720 --> 01:22:15,719
...then...

996
01:22:16,280 --> 01:22:20,519
...if I would support you like this or not.
Right?

997
01:22:25,600 --> 01:22:26,599
Look son.

998
01:22:28,040 --> 01:22:28,919
I talk to you...

999
01:22:30,800 --> 01:22:33,599
...and I didn't tell you,
you can't marry her.

1000
01:22:36,320 --> 01:22:38,039
I support you.

1001
01:22:39,960 --> 01:22:41,999
I will help you.

1002
01:22:44,360 --> 01:22:45,759
You'll marry Gonca.

1003
01:22:48,240 --> 01:22:49,799
I'm glad you're here father.

1004
01:22:50,280 --> 01:22:51,199
I'm glad you're here.

1005
01:22:58,200 --> 01:23:00,679
My brave boy. My brave boy.

1006
01:23:02,160 --> 01:23:02,559
My Bey.

1007
01:23:04,800 --> 01:23:06,319
Sorry to interrupt.

1008
01:23:06,560 --> 01:23:07,719
Imren Tegin...

1009
01:23:08,440 --> 01:23:09,719
In return for Gunduz Bey...

1010
01:23:10,480 --> 01:23:11,719
...he wants the gold too.

1011
01:23:12,240 --> 01:23:13,719
Well...

1012
01:23:14,040 --> 01:23:15,719
Of course he does.

1013
01:23:16,800 --> 01:23:19,239
We'll give him more than that.

1014
01:23:23,600 --> 01:23:24,799
Thank you father.

1015
01:23:29,360 --> 01:23:32,239
Germiyanoglu Border - Frontier Market

1016
01:23:35,640 --> 01:23:36,999
Tell me Gonca.

1017
01:23:37,000 --> 01:23:38,919
What do you want to talk about?

1018
01:23:38,920 --> 01:23:40,919
I won't marry Candaroglu.

1019
01:23:50,320 --> 01:23:51,479
What are you saying Gonca?

1020
01:23:51,760 --> 01:23:53,479
The promise was made.

1021
01:23:53,600 --> 01:23:55,319
I didn't promise anyone brother.

1022
01:23:55,320 --> 01:23:57,319
I'll send word to my father.

1023
01:23:58,760 --> 01:23:59,959
Gonca.

1024
01:24:00,160 --> 01:24:04,359
I'll marry Alaeddin who I love and loves me.

1025
01:24:07,600 --> 01:24:09,199
You lost your mind.

1026
01:24:09,240 --> 01:24:10,919
I haven't.

1027
01:24:11,400 --> 01:24:13,879
I won't let anyone hurt me.

1028
01:24:13,880 --> 01:24:15,879
This is my last word brother.

1029
01:24:16,920 --> 01:24:18,959
You'll marry Alaeddin?

1030
01:24:19,080 --> 01:24:20,959
My father won't allow it.

1031
01:24:21,000 --> 01:24:23,239
I'll talk to him and he'll allow it.

1032
01:24:23,600 --> 01:24:25,239
But...

1033
01:24:25,240 --> 01:24:26,879
...if he doesn't...

1034
01:24:26,880 --> 01:24:28,079
If he doesn't?

1035
01:24:29,560 --> 01:24:30,439
What will you do?

1036
01:24:31,200 --> 01:24:32,359
Run off with Alaeddin?

1037
01:24:32,920 --> 01:24:33,439
Will you?

1038
01:24:39,560 --> 01:24:40,599
I won't let you.

1039
01:24:41,880 --> 01:24:42,639
Guice.

1040
01:24:42,920 --> 01:24:45,239
Fitnat. Cage Gonca in the tent.

1041
01:24:45,320 --> 01:24:46,159
Don't.

1042
01:24:47,160 --> 01:24:48,119
Brother.

1043
01:24:48,400 --> 01:24:50,879
Let go. Let me go brother.

1044
01:24:50,880 --> 01:24:53,159
You can't do this to me okay?

1045
01:24:53,160 --> 01:24:54,479
Is this how you'll stop me?

1046
01:24:54,480 --> 01:24:55,759
You can't stop me.

1047
01:24:55,800 --> 01:24:58,639
If I don't lock you, you'll slander our name.

1048
01:24:59,360 --> 01:25:00,639
I won't let it.

1049
01:25:00,640 --> 01:25:01,439
Brother.

1050
01:25:01,440 --> 01:25:03,879
Alps will stay by the tent.

1051
01:25:04,160 --> 01:25:06,599
Let go.
-Come on.

1052
01:25:06,800 --> 01:25:07,599
Let go.

1053
01:25:07,840 --> 01:25:09,679
Is this how you'll stop me?

1054
01:25:09,680 --> 01:25:11,679
Let me go.
-Brother.

1055
01:25:32,120 --> 01:25:32,959
Stop!

1056
01:25:33,960 --> 01:25:36,159
How dare you stop us?

1057
01:25:39,000 --> 01:25:40,239
Give us the gold.

1058
01:25:42,000 --> 01:25:43,599
And we'll let you go.

1059
01:25:44,880 --> 01:25:48,959
Alps never bend to scavengers. We won't do it now.

1060
01:25:49,800 --> 01:25:50,719
Alps!

1061
01:26:01,080 --> 01:26:03,279
You can't have the gold before killing us.

1062
01:26:08,400 --> 01:26:10,079
Then it's a shame.

1063
01:26:10,560 --> 01:26:11,519
Don't fight.

1064
01:26:12,680 --> 01:26:13,919
We'll kill you all.

1065
01:26:15,040 --> 01:26:16,679
Konur Bey.

1066
01:26:17,960 --> 01:26:19,799
You work with scavengers?

1067
01:26:21,640 --> 01:26:23,079
Shame on you.

1068
01:26:23,080 --> 01:26:25,079
Shut up.

1069
01:26:25,200 --> 01:26:26,639
Don't do this Konur Bey.

1070
01:26:27,560 --> 01:26:29,039
This is my Beys gold.

1071
01:26:29,840 --> 01:26:31,039
You'll be in trouble.

1072
01:26:31,640 --> 01:26:32,679
It's mine now.

1073
01:26:34,160 --> 01:26:35,159
Take the gold.

1074
01:26:36,240 --> 01:26:37,119
Come on.

1075
01:26:42,360 --> 01:26:44,359
To save the Alps...

1076
01:26:44,880 --> 01:26:46,879
...we'll give you the gold.

1077
01:26:47,640 --> 01:26:48,879
But...

1078
01:26:49,320 --> 01:26:50,879
...when Osman Bey hears this...

1079
01:26:52,000 --> 01:26:53,919
...he'll go after you.

1080
01:26:53,920 --> 01:26:54,719
It's okay.

1081
01:26:55,640 --> 01:26:56,719
Take the horses...

1082
01:26:57,840 --> 01:26:59,199
...so they don't follow us.

1083
01:27:15,480 --> 01:27:17,239
Konur Bey.

1084
01:27:18,120 --> 01:27:22,519
What happened Aykurt?
Did the one you trust betray it?

1085
01:27:24,600 --> 01:27:27,639
Let's see what's going to happen
once Osman Bey hears this.

1086
01:27:30,480 --> 01:27:31,839
Shame.

1087
01:27:32,720 --> 01:27:36,159
Come on, alps, come on.

1088
01:27:41,160 --> 01:27:43,559
The brave men of Kayi...

1089
01:27:43,560 --> 01:27:45,279
...sisters...

1090
01:27:45,280 --> 01:27:46,719
We...

1091
01:27:46,720 --> 01:27:51,359
...chose Kestle, Kite and Atranos...

1092
01:27:51,360 --> 01:27:53,239
...for Bursa...

1093
01:27:53,240 --> 01:27:56,519
...as targets.

1094
01:27:56,920 --> 01:28:01,079
But now the infidels only have Atranos now.

1095
01:28:01,320 --> 01:28:04,319
They wanted to use Atranos as a headquarter.

1096
01:28:04,440 --> 01:28:06,679
They wanted to gather their armies there...

1097
01:28:06,680 --> 01:28:09,719
...and then attack our lands.

1098
01:28:09,720 --> 01:28:13,359
However, thank Allah, we didn't let them.

1099
01:28:13,360 --> 01:28:16,119
Thank Allah!

1100
01:28:16,800 --> 01:28:18,359
Now...

1101
01:28:18,360 --> 01:28:22,319
...this is the last day of
the infidels having Atranos.

1102
01:28:23,960 --> 01:28:26,279
First, we will conquer it.

1103
01:28:26,280 --> 01:28:28,679
We're going to save Gunduz Bey.

1104
01:28:28,680 --> 01:28:33,519
And then we will parade that Imren's
head from one land to the other.

1105
01:28:35,800 --> 01:28:43,839
They will see what the end of those
who want to attack our lands meet.

1106
01:28:46,800 --> 01:28:48,439
Now tell me.

1107
01:28:48,440 --> 01:28:50,639
The brave men of Kayi...

1108
01:28:50,640 --> 01:28:52,919
...honorable sisters...

1109
01:28:52,920 --> 01:28:55,719
...are you with me to fight...

1110
01:28:55,720 --> 01:28:57,799
...on this mubarak Ramadan day?

1111
01:28:57,800 --> 01:28:59,599
We are Osman Bey.

1112
01:28:59,600 --> 01:29:00,319
Are you with me?

1113
01:29:00,320 --> 01:29:01,879
We are Osman Bey.

1114
01:29:01,880 --> 01:29:02,879
Are you with me?

1115
01:29:02,880 --> 01:29:05,639
We are Osman Bey.

1116
01:29:05,960 --> 01:29:08,479
Thank you, thank you.

1117
01:29:13,640 --> 01:29:16,239
Now we're going-to save Gunduz Bey.

1118
01:29:20,000 --> 01:29:22,479
Then swords and..

1119
01:29:23,840 --> 01:29:26,319
...fire will do the talking.

1120
01:29:27,280 --> 01:29:28,919
Come on.

1121
01:30:11,520 --> 01:30:14,519
Germitanoglu Border - Frontier Market

1122
01:30:14,600 --> 01:30:16,919
I don't want any mistakes.

1123
01:30:16,920 --> 01:30:19,839
This market will be better
than it was before. Come on.

1124
01:30:19,840 --> 01:30:22,439
As you wish my Shahzade.

1125
01:30:25,720 --> 01:30:29,519
Someone trusted to you is
a very big challenge right?

1126
01:30:29,680 --> 01:30:31,719
Mehmet Bey.

1127
01:30:32,560 --> 01:30:35,439
Our Prophet said...

1128
01:30:36,480 --> 01:30:40,079
...if you have something that was
trusted to you then wait for the doomsday.

1129
01:30:40,440 --> 01:30:43,159
You say it so well Dervish.

1130
01:30:43,600 --> 01:30:44,879
Right.

1131
01:30:44,880 --> 01:30:46,279
It's a big challenge.

1132
01:30:46,480 --> 01:30:48,519
But thank Allah...

1133
01:30:48,520 --> 01:30:50,679
...I don't betray it.

1134
01:30:50,720 --> 01:30:54,039
This market will be better than it
was when Yakup Bey left it to me.

1135
01:30:54,440 --> 01:30:59,639
We don't know if it's your
nafs or your heart that's talking.

1136
01:30:59,760 --> 01:31:03,919
But did Yakup Bey trust you with just this market?

1137
01:31:04,160 --> 01:31:06,959
Then again the other one...

1138
01:31:07,080 --> 01:31:09,839
...was trusted to you way before this.

1139
01:31:10,080 --> 01:31:12,319
In The Farewell Sermon...

1140
01:31:13,040 --> 01:31:15,279
In Thet Farewell Sermon...

1141
01:31:15,280 --> 01:31:20,199
...the Prophet says, women
are trusted to you by Allah.

1142
01:31:20,360 --> 01:31:24,319
If you don't take care of it...

1143
01:31:24,320 --> 01:31:27,759
...if you don't offer them peace...

1144
01:31:28,760 --> 01:31:32,439
...then you bring your life closer to doomsday.

1145
01:31:33,360 --> 01:31:36,159
I have my mother and sister.

1146
01:31:36,720 --> 01:31:39,519
I take care of them both.

1147
01:31:39,960 --> 01:31:41,439
My sister...

1148
01:31:42,320 --> 01:31:44,719
For her happiness...

1149
01:31:45,120 --> 01:31:48,039
...I even risk being the bad guy in her eyes.

1150
01:31:50,840 --> 01:31:55,399
So, you make decisions for her, is that so?

1151
01:31:56,000 --> 01:31:58,879
I just thought of this.

1152
01:31:59,600 --> 01:32:02,079
One day, a woman...

1153
01:32:02,240 --> 01:32:05,199
...goes to our Prophet...

1154
01:32:05,920 --> 01:32:10,439
"Oh prophet, my father is making me marry...

1155
01:32:10,600 --> 01:32:13,639
...to his brother's son, to gain more reputation."

1156
01:32:14,240 --> 01:32:16,279
"But I don't want it."

1157
01:32:17,360 --> 01:32:20,959
The prophet called her father.

1158
01:32:22,040 --> 01:32:28,319
And did not accept father's decision
without the consent of the daughter.

1159
01:32:30,520 --> 01:32:33,919
He let the girl decide whether
or not she wants to marry.

1160
01:32:38,360 --> 01:32:43,439
Now you might ask why I am telling you all these.

1161
01:32:45,800 --> 01:32:51,199
So you can find the path of Haqq through sunnah.

1162
01:32:51,840 --> 01:32:55,919
So you can act with your heart, not with your nafs.

1163
01:32:57,520 --> 01:33:01,919
So you can be sure you do not
betray what's entrusted to you.

1164
01:33:04,080 --> 01:33:06,959
Prophet says...

1165
01:33:10,000 --> 01:33:14,119
"Only those with dignity...

1166
01:33:14,120 --> 01:33:17,599
...and honor value the women".

1167
01:33:19,280 --> 01:33:24,799
"Only evil and degenerate ones see them lowly"

1168
01:33:28,080 --> 01:33:31,239
May Allah make you and everyone...

1169
01:33:31,440 --> 01:33:35,239
...become one of those with dignity and honor.

1170
01:33:36,920 --> 01:33:39,159
Ameen, Dervish afendi.

1171
01:33:40,120 --> 01:33:42,799
Stay safe.

1172
01:33:57,040 --> 01:33:58,559
Gonca.

1173
01:34:00,080 --> 01:34:00,999
Sister.

1174
01:34:26,080 --> 01:34:29,319
Gunduz Bey is here, Osman Bey.

1175
01:34:31,040 --> 01:34:34,359
He is not as healthy as when I captured him.

1176
01:34:38,080 --> 01:34:40,599
And I got Cardinal and the ambassadors.

1177
01:34:41,080 --> 01:34:42,479
Bring them.

1178
01:34:43,400 --> 01:34:45,719
Come here.

1179
01:34:51,160 --> 01:34:54,199
You dared to hit them, huh?

1180
01:34:54,320 --> 01:34:56,839
Imren Tegin or whatever your name is.

1181
01:34:57,520 --> 01:34:59,479
I am going to torment you more!

1182
01:35:01,080 --> 01:35:03,519
I am going to torment you more!

1183
01:35:04,640 --> 01:35:09,719
But you did not even do anything remarkable.
You just hide in holes like a rat.

1184
01:35:10,160 --> 01:35:12,239
You devise treacherous schemes.

1185
01:35:13,560 --> 01:35:15,079
And that's what suits you best.

1186
01:35:15,080 --> 01:35:17,199
You will soon see my power.

1187
01:35:17,520 --> 01:35:21,799
I will turn you
mad out of anger.

1188
01:35:24,160 --> 01:35:27,559
And I will be there to take
your head in your first mistake.

1189
01:35:27,760 --> 01:35:29,239
Yeah, yeah.

1190
01:35:29,520 --> 01:35:31,079
The war is just beginning.

1191
01:35:31,360 --> 01:35:34,719
No. the war will be over soon.

1192
01:35:36,280 --> 01:35:38,559
Now give Gunduz Bey to me.

1193
01:35:59,440 --> 01:36:01,399
Osman Bey.

1194
01:36:05,000 --> 01:36:08,719
Olivia, I am taking my father back...

1195
01:36:09,320 --> 01:36:12,999
...but I will make you pay
for my sister-in-law Ayca!

1196
01:36:13,240 --> 01:36:16,039
I am going to take your pitiful life with my hands!

1197
01:36:16,040 --> 01:36:18,919
You will end up like your crazy sister too.

1198
01:36:19,280 --> 01:36:22,639
You should pray to Cardinal
for your father's safety.

1199
01:36:35,560 --> 01:36:37,439
Gunduz Bey, are you okay?

1200
01:36:37,640 --> 01:36:40,439
I am okay, Osman Bey, thank you.

1201
01:36:40,600 --> 01:36:42,439
Okay.

1202
01:36:44,320 --> 01:36:45,399
Father.

1203
01:36:45,560 --> 01:36:48,519
I am okay, my girl.

1204
01:36:51,200 --> 01:36:53,759
Thanks to Osman Bey.

1205
01:36:54,760 --> 01:36:57,079
Father, Ayca...

1206
01:36:57,440 --> 01:37:01,479
I heard about it in my imprisonment.

1207
01:37:02,320 --> 01:37:04,399
I am sorry for our loss.

1208
01:37:07,800 --> 01:37:11,879
It would be better if we hadn't
sent these dogs, Osman Bey.

1209
01:37:12,360 --> 01:37:14,519
Don't worry, Gunduz Bey.

1210
01:37:14,520 --> 01:37:18,279
We will take their lives, and their castles.

1211
01:37:31,360 --> 01:37:33,759
Our trade ends here, Osman Bey.

1212
01:37:33,760 --> 01:37:37,599
Don't forget, until one of us dies.

1213
01:37:37,880 --> 01:37:40,119
Until one of us dies.

1214
01:37:40,320 --> 01:37:42,519
But you should not forget this either.

1215
01:37:43,480 --> 01:37:46,039
You don't have much time left.

1216
01:37:56,960 --> 01:37:59,239
What are we going to do now, huh Osman Bey?

1217
01:37:59,240 --> 01:38:01,639
We came here to take Atranos.

1218
01:38:02,640 --> 01:38:04,159
And we will do that.

1219
01:38:05,480 --> 01:38:08,679
We are going to Atranos, come on alps!

1220
01:38:12,640 --> 01:38:36,799
Long live Imren Tegin!
Long live Imren Tegin!

1221
01:38:38,040 --> 01:38:41,639
Prepare festivities for taking the
gold back and saving the cardinal.

1222
01:38:45,200 --> 01:38:47,239
Today is our day.

1223
01:38:50,040 --> 01:38:51,439
Our day?

1224
01:38:52,000 --> 01:38:54,959
Because of you stupidity we almost died.

1225
01:38:56,080 --> 01:38:57,879
You trusted Osman and ruined it all.

1226
01:38:58,400 --> 01:38:59,879
You'll pay for it.

1227
01:39:00,440 --> 01:39:01,599
Imren Tegin.

1228
01:39:01,880 --> 01:39:02,759
No.

1229
01:39:03,280 --> 01:39:04,919
Nothing over yet.

1230
01:39:05,760 --> 01:39:07,399
When the crusaders come...

1231
01:39:07,480 --> 01:39:09,119
There are no crusaders.

1232
01:39:09,640 --> 01:39:11,079
I'll revoke your authority.

1233
01:39:12,960 --> 01:39:15,799
I brought together the Pope and Olcaytu.

1234
01:39:16,320 --> 01:39:18,519
No one can revoke anything.

1235
01:39:18,640 --> 01:39:20,359
You trust yourself too much.

1236
01:39:20,360 --> 01:39:23,399
Your failure will be known and you'll die.

1237
01:39:25,080 --> 01:39:26,279
This is a war.

1238
01:39:26,960 --> 01:39:28,399
And war is not over.

1239
01:39:29,520 --> 01:39:31,279
But you're cowards.

1240
01:39:31,720 --> 01:39:33,479
I can't win with cowards.

1241
01:39:33,680 --> 01:39:35,479
You can't talk to us like that.

1242
01:39:37,040 --> 01:39:38,199
You're right.

1243
01:39:38,440 --> 01:39:40,199
No more talking.

1244
01:39:50,400 --> 01:39:51,239
Bend the knee.

1245
01:40:05,720 --> 01:40:08,759
If you kill me Pope will destroy you.

1246
01:40:09,040 --> 01:40:10,759
Don't worry cardinal.

1247
01:40:11,160 --> 01:40:12,759
I won't kill you.

1248
01:40:13,960 --> 01:40:15,999
You'll tell Pope what I'll say.

1249
01:40:38,080 --> 01:40:39,439
Ayca.

1250
01:40:40,000 --> 01:40:41,439
My daughter in law.

1251
01:40:41,720 --> 01:40:43,439
My son left her to me.

1252
01:40:45,600 --> 01:40:47,799
I couldn't protect my son...

1253
01:40:48,000 --> 01:40:49,799
...or his wife.

1254
01:40:50,400 --> 01:40:52,479
Don't blame yourself father.

1255
01:40:54,200 --> 01:40:55,879
She lost her mind.

1256
01:40:55,960 --> 01:40:57,879
We couldn't protect her mind.

1257
01:41:00,360 --> 01:41:02,559
We couldn't stop the poison.

1258
01:41:03,640 --> 01:41:05,239
We're responsible for

1259
01:41:06,320 --> 01:41:09,599
When I kill Olivia, she'll be avenged.

1260
01:41:12,840 --> 01:41:14,719
I never knew...

1261
01:41:15,000 --> 01:41:16,719
...he'd go this far.

1262
01:41:18,400 --> 01:41:20,519
He did it.
-He did it.

1263
01:41:20,520 --> 01:41:22,239
Cerkutay Bey.

1264
01:41:22,320 --> 01:41:23,639
The Konur I saw...

1265
01:41:24,240 --> 01:41:25,639
...wasn't the one I know.

1266
01:41:25,800 --> 01:41:27,119
He's right.

1267
01:41:27,400 --> 01:41:28,999
We knew him wrong.

1268
01:41:29,000 --> 01:41:30,999
Don't say that Baysungur.

1269
01:41:31,440 --> 01:41:32,999
He's Konur Bey.

1270
01:41:33,760 --> 01:41:37,279
Nothing can excuse him trapping Alps...

1271
01:41:37,280 --> 01:41:39,719
...and taking Osman Bey's gold.

1272
01:41:39,720 --> 01:41:41,319
Don't do this brothers.

1273
01:41:42,600 --> 01:41:43,959
Alps.

1274
01:41:45,760 --> 01:41:47,759
What are you talking about?

1275
01:41:48,320 --> 01:41:48,959
My Bey.

1276
01:41:51,760 --> 01:41:53,839
I don't want to say it but...

1277
01:41:55,480 --> 01:41:56,119
...Konur Bey...

1278
01:41:58,560 --> 01:42:01,399
...took the gold we sent to Sogut.

1279
01:42:02,640 --> 01:42:04,879
He had some disordered men with him.

1280
01:42:13,000 --> 01:42:14,559
Konur's on his own.

1281
01:42:21,080 --> 01:42:22,559
There's nothing to say.

1282
01:42:22,920 --> 01:42:24,559
I wish he won't die by my hand.

1283
01:42:27,440 --> 01:42:29,759
Come on. Give the Alps the news.

1284
01:42:30,600 --> 01:42:31,759
Atranos...

1285
01:42:32,320 --> 01:42:34,319
...will be Turk's today.

1286
01:42:34,440 --> 01:42:36,759
-If Allah permits, my Bey.
-If Allah permits, my Bey.

1287
01:42:38,160 --> 01:42:39,079
Come on.

1288
01:42:49,560 --> 01:43:05,159
Long Live Imren Tegin!

1289
01:43:12,240 --> 01:43:12,839
My Bey.

1290
01:43:13,560 --> 01:43:15,199
We can't go further with horses.

1291
01:43:16,080 --> 01:43:17,239
Let's go.

1292
01:43:21,800 --> 01:43:22,479
Alps.

1293
01:43:23,160 --> 01:43:25,119
We'll move quietly.

1294
01:43:25,280 --> 01:43:27,119
We have a castle to conquer...

1295
01:43:27,280 --> 01:43:29,119
...and a head to cut off.

1296
01:43:31,400 --> 01:43:32,399
Come on.

1297
01:43:52,240 --> 01:43:53,439
Come on.

1298
01:43:53,440 --> 01:43:55,199
We'll go to Osman Bey.

1299
01:43:55,240 --> 01:43:56,759
Sisters.

1300
01:43:56,760 --> 01:43:58,399
Watch our backs.

1301
01:43:58,400 --> 01:43:59,519
Come on

1302
01:44:05,280 --> 01:44:07,599
This way my bey.

1303
01:44:14,800 --> 01:44:17,519
This is the hidden passage, my bey.

1304
01:44:19,240 --> 01:44:22,639
Atranos will become Turks' land today.

1305
01:44:24,120 --> 01:44:26,079
Imren.

1306
01:44:26,600 --> 01:44:29,319
Your time is up now.

1307
01:44:30,320 --> 01:44:32,799
You'll die today.

1308
01:44:33,480 --> 01:44:34,879
Alps.

1309
01:44:35,200 --> 01:44:36,639
Come on.

1310
01:44:40,680 --> 01:44:42,479
Allah is Everlasting.

1311
01:44:42,480 --> 01:44:43,259
Come on.

1312
01:44:43,259 --> 01:44:44,959
Allah is Everlasting.

1313
01:45:55,520 --> 01:45:58,719
We have to pass these
passages before that cart explodes.

1314
01:45:58,720 --> 01:46:00,439
Be careful.

1315
01:46:00,440 --> 01:46:03,679
We won't let anyone go out of here.

1316
01:46:03,680 --> 01:46:06,359
I won't any one of them live.

1317
01:46:06,360 --> 01:46:09,759
I won't stop until I take my
daughter's revenge, Osman Bey.

1318
01:46:09,760 --> 01:46:13,039
Gunduz Bey who has hold
on to his revenge, don't worry.

1319
01:46:13,040 --> 01:46:14,759
Today is the day of revenge.

1320
01:46:14,760 --> 01:46:16,399
If Allah permits, if Allah permits.

1321
01:46:16,400 --> 01:46:18,119
Come on.

1322
01:46:23,640 --> 01:46:25,919
Sisters, we're going to stay here.

1323
01:46:25,920 --> 01:46:28,639
We will hunt down cowards that leave the castle.

1324
01:46:28,640 --> 01:46:29,879
Come on.

1325
01:46:54,640 --> 01:46:57,119
Your people are proud of you.

1326
01:47:18,720 --> 01:47:23,279
Long live Imren Tegin.

1327
01:47:25,560 --> 01:47:28,119
Long live Imren Tegin.

1328
01:47:35,120 --> 01:47:37,279
Long live Imren Tegin.

1329
01:47:43,200 --> 01:47:44,919
Long live Imren Tegin.

1330
01:47:48,600 --> 01:47:49,759
Imren Tegin.

1331
01:47:50,880 --> 01:47:53,239
Loyal subjects of Rome.

1332
01:47:53,240 --> 01:47:56,599
The strong soldiers of blessed lands.

1333
01:47:56,600 --> 01:47:59,999
This gold signals our rebirth...

1334
01:48:00,000 --> 01:48:02,959
...and Osman's death.

1335
01:48:02,960 --> 01:48:13,239
Death to Osman.

1336
01:48:13,320 --> 01:48:15,519
Osman who has subjected Rome to fear...

1337
01:48:15,520 --> 01:48:17,479
...will die now.

1338
01:48:17,760 --> 01:48:22,239
That coward's land will be
destroyed under our horses' shoes.

1339
01:48:22,520 --> 01:48:26,759
His men will die by our soldier's swords.

1340
01:48:26,760 --> 01:48:31,599
These lands which they've turned into
hell will become heaven with us again.

1341
